      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Ímã. As ondas eletromagnéticas emitidas pelas unidades nas laterais de sua cabeça anulam a gravidade, permitindo que Magnemite flutue. Ele se locomove pairando o tempo todo e também descarrega ondas eletromagnéticas por essas unidades.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Mineral &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Magnemite pode evoluir para Magneton no nível 10 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Supersonic, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Thunder Shock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Thunder Wave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Magnet Bomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Light Screen</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Sonic Boom</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Spark</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Mirror Shot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Metal Sound</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Electro Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Flash Cannon</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Discharge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Lock-On</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Gyro Ball, Magnet Rise, Zap Cannon</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Charge, Charge Beam, Confide, Confuse Ray, Double Team, Eerie Impulse, Electric Terrain, Electro Ball, Electroweb, Endure, Explosion, Facade, Flash Cannon, Frustration, Gravity, Gyro Ball, Heavy Slam, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Defense, Iron Head, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Magnet Rise, Metal Sound, Protect, Psych Up, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Rising Voltage, Round, Sandstorm, Screech, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Sleep Talk, Snore, Steel Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thunder, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Volt Switch, Wild Charge</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Electroweb, Explosion</p>",
